"P1252592687" "Good work, {HeroName}, good work. Those Praetorians are a devious lot. I am glad we stopped Neuron when we did. Wait, isn't he supposed to be locked up in the Zig? I should be keeping better tabs on these guys."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Stabilizer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1244629870" "Irising stabilizer"
// DetailString :
"P3138225147" "This small handheld device was designed by the technicians at Portal Corporation. It should help you maintain the patches keeping the dimensional ruptures on Werewolf World in check."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Tome 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3004006286" "The Path of the Dark"
// DetailString :
"P3192860403" "This heavy tome details the rituals of a mysterious cult called the Path of the Dark. The last pages are filled with handwritten notes. They read: <br><br>'The Shadow Seed was brought to Paragon City, and here it was implanted. A foolish youngster called {HeroName} tried to stop me, but it was no contest. The nuisance was easily dispatched. If I had only known what was in store, perhaps I would have hoped to lose. <br><br>'The Shadow has spread far and wide, encompassing everything on this forsaken world. The people I would have ruled have been turned to darkness, or are gone forever. Only the Nicti are left, and their demon wolves, and I myself, <br><br>'Requiem'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P396801907" "Do you remember that strange world of werewolves, the one where you set up those dimensional patches? Well, apparently they need maintenance. If we don't keep the patches in good working order, those dimensional ruptures could split wide open. Then it'll be time to stock up on silver bullets. I'd like to prevent that from happening. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Get over to Werewolf World and fix those dimensional patches.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3060920727" "Go to Werewolf World and fix the dimensional patches"
// SendOffString :
"P1127195847" "While you're there, the scientists want you to look for any clues to the nature of Werewolf World. They're always curious."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P983625408" "Maintain dimensional patches"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P590886697" "You've got more work to do in Werewolf World."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P526902517" "The sun never seems to shine on this blasted landscape."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3105795843" "Greywulf"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P177144126" "Grrrrrr."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2526984549" "GRRAAARR!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
