"P3600912939" "Looking..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4110193299" "They call this gadget a 'irising stabilizer.' Whatever it is, it'll let you fix those patches."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4034681731" "You fixed the dimensional patches and learned the history of this world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3671831585" "Are you telling me that Requiem is still alive somewhere on that world of werewolves? The only human left? Or half human, anyway. That must be a hard cross to bear, even for someone as solitary as Requiem. Guess I can't feel too sorry for him, though. After all, he brought that doom on himself."
// RandomFameString :
"P1319673347" "{HeroName} said something about a world full of werewolves. Sounds like crazy talk to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2746349403" "I just got word of a major security breach. The Freakshow's leader, Dreck, managed to break into Portal Corporation and access another dimension. He chose dimension Nu Beta 9-7, a war torn world with few remaining defenses. He plans to set himself up as the lord of that dimension! As far as I'm concerned, the Freakshow are our problem, not Nu Beta 9-7's. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to go in there and arrest Dreck, the leader of the Freakshow.</A> You'll need allies, and you'll have to do it fast. You'll only have 90 minutes before we lose our lock on Dreck's current location."
// AcceptString :
"P2686744648" "Arrest Dreck on Nu Beta 9-7 in under 90 minutes."
// SendOffString :
"P3417598340" "We've managed to isolate the Freaks within a force field, along with a few unlucky citizens of Nu Beta 9-7. Remember, the Freakshow are nothing without Dreck. Take him into custody, and this whole problem should go away. But you'll only have 90 minutes. Get a move on!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3556996431" "Arrest Dreck & his henchmen"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P141937520" "I won't stand for the Freaks running roughshod over the multiverse. You've got to end this before we lose them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2964487640" "A hoot of malicious laughter echoes in the air."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P144265759" "This world is ours, baby! Ours!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1782564141" "Ain't chaos grand?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P694089852" "Step off!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3348467166" "Dreck"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2298821263" "Which do you like better? Lord Dreck? Or Dreck, Emperor of Desolation?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P40195690" "I'll turn you into a rug beneath my throne!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Dreck 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1465304210" "War weary civilian"
// Description :
"P983565451" "hostages to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1386619695" "Save the last hostage!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1382925378" "Our world has been in chaos ever since the war! And now this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1880922155" "They seem to think this desolation is a paradise!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1668124451" "The Council left us so little! Why do these people want to take it?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P571675657" "With villains like these guys, your world must have worse problems than ours!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3940290052" "You stopped the Freaks' incursion into Nu Beta 9-7."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2352576357" "Dreck has escaped justice on Nu Beta 9-7!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3591802121" "From what I understand, Nu Beta 9-7 just fought a terrible war against their own version of the Council. They won it, but at a terrible cost. You saw what it was like there: tumbled ruins, no cars or Light Rail, little infrastructure of any kind. Trust the Freakshow to always find the weakest prey to sink their teeth into. I hope we've given the people of Nu Beta 9-7 a shot at rebuilding their world. With Dreck in prison, this world also got a big boost."
// RandomFameString :
"P2340907318" "{HeroName} put Dreck in prison!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P206845839" "I feel so sorry for the people of Nu Beta 9-7. From what I understand, they just fought a terrible war against their own version of the Council. They won it, but at a terrible cost. You saw what it was like there: tumbled ruins, no cars or Light Rail, little infrastructure of any kind. Trust the Freakshow to always find the weakest prey to sink their teeth into. And now Dreck is lose there, and no doubt on a rampage. I just hope they find a way to stop him. Maybe having a common enemy will bring those people together, but in all honesty, I don't have much hope for them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Compound9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AdvisorStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1690467887" "Alfred Yaney's story"
// DetailString :
"P1287765960" "When you rescued Alfred Yaney, he told you: <br><br>'So, you want to know how Nemesis conquered my world, eh? Well, it was a doomsday device. A powerful machine that could wipe out a whole city. Once New York was gone, and San Francisco, and Dallas, everyone agreed to serve Nemesis. <br><br>'But, listen, if you're really interested in Nemesis' tactics, you should explore some of the other dimensions he's conquered. That's right. Several dimensions are ruled by their own versions of Nemesis. That's why I was kidnapped in the first place. They want me to help them coordinate attacks on the other Nemesis dimensions. Nemesis won't be happy until he controls the entire multiverse, and he considers his other selves his steepest competition.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CitizenStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P225401944" "The citizen's story"
// DetailString :
"P2880393662" "One of the citizens you rescued told you: <br><br>'Sure, I'll tell you how Nemesis conquered my world. It's the least I can do, after you saved me from that mob. Well, it all went down like this: Nemesis found a way to permanently blot out the sun. Some sort of self-replicating smog machines or something. After that, we had no choice but to follow him. He had the only reliable methods for providing energy and light!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TrollStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4092660623" "The Troll's story"
// DetailString :
"P3507622081" "One of the Trolls you rescued told you: <br><br>'You want know about Nemesis? Okay. He first to bring Superadine. Sweet, sweet Superadine. He make everyone take it. Then, he cut us off. We cry and beg, but no Superadine! Only get Superadine if we serve. Me very good servant!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1245261793" "Perhaps you've heard of a dimension called Gamma Upsilon 28-3. It's ruled over by a brutal Nemesis, who's opposed by a secret cadre of freedom fighters. Portal Corporation's heroes have helped those freedom fighters before. Well, it looks like it's time to do so again. I was just contacted by the leader of the resistance, Julianne Thompson. She says that her most valuable military advisor has been kidnapped and forced to work for Nemesis. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If we can't save that military advisor, it may mean the end of freedom on Gamma Upsilon 28-3.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1039962397" "Save the military advisor from Nemesis"
// SendOffString :
"P930171808" "While you're there, I'd like you to find out anything you can about how Nemesis conquered that world. This request comes all the way from the FBSA."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Compound9_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1430602923" "Save the military advisor"
