// RandomFameString :
"P2160107566" "I hear a bunch of Portal scientists got lost in another dimension!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Files 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P913533811" "Crey Conglomerate files"
// DetailString :
"P2383769909" "These files detail the progress of Sigma Psi 20-7's Revenant Hero Project. Apparently something went wrong in the mental programming of the manufactured heroes. Their creators found that the Revenant Heroes could think, and act, as one person. The last entry reads: <br><br>'The subjects have become distrustful of anyone whose thoughts they cannot share. Preliminary findings indicate this could become a problem.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2125548809" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I've got a new dimension for you to investigate, {HeroName}.</A> Strictly recon. No one's laid eyes on it yet, but the scientists have been getting abnormally high readings for super-powered activity. That means a hero goes in first. Guess you're nominated."
// SendOffString :
"P348478390" "We're calling it Sigma Psi 20-7 for now. Come up with something catchier, and we'll put it in the database."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P496048293" "Investigate Sigma Psi 20-7"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2193519693" "We need some hard data on Sigma Psi 20-7."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3279409131" "A torn and faded poster on the wall touts the virtues of Crey Conglomerate."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P13421283" "I think that..."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P932673872" "...a stranger has arrived."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2456041818" "You are not one of me!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P690079841" "A newcomer? How..."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2701103743" "...disturbing. I'm used to being alone."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P852793632" "Who are you? Where did you come from?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3020482764" "Protector 96703"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3170999056" "I have not seen a stranger in years."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1154061296" "I am alone! I will be left alone!"

