// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P996310964" "Did Levy rat us out?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3283368982" "Sorry, hero, but you're not useful enough to keep alive."

