// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1267984792" "The Malta Group has been a thorn in my side ever since they learned the extent of Portal Corporation's technology. No matter how many defenses we set up, they won't stop trying to invade our labs. I need you to get on the streets and show the Malta Group that Portal Corporation can play dirty. What do you say? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you defeat a few Malta agents in the name of science?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P166407207" "Defeat a few Malta agents"
// SendOffString :
"P2258188055" "Make sure the Malta Group knows that Portal Corporation won't tolerate continued interference. You can usually find them right here on Peregrine Island, near Poseidon Square or Mera Heights."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3394176332" "Defeat Malta agents"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2991301430" "I don't know if Malta's gotten the message yet. Better hammer it home."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1618903743" "{HeroName} engaged. Use of extreme force is authorized."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1319241384" "You discouraged the Malta agents from attacking Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P541839131" "Malta's not an enemy to be defeated in one battle. We'll have to continue waging the war to keep Portal Corporation's technology away from their prying eyes, but at least you fired some good opening shots for us. Thanks, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P600430704" "Malta doesn't look so tough when {HeroName} goes after them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2081954870" "The Devouring Earth are causing a big problem on Peregrine Island. They're rampaging, causing damage, and generally stirring up a fuss. A lot of the technicians have been complaining that they simply don't feel safe. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think someone's got to take out some of the Devouring Earth on Peregrine Island.</A> Know who that someone is? You."
// AcceptString :
"P238659035" "Take out some of the Devouring Earth on Peregrine Island"
// SendOffString :
"P2744533435" "You can find the creatures pretty reliably near Nelson Borough or Mera Heights. Be careful, {HeroName}. A battle with the Devouring Earth is never easy. "
// ActiveTaskString :
"P951954028" "Defend Peregrine from creatures"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3757982328" "The Devouring Earth situation on Peregrine Island is still pretty dicey. Best get back to work."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P217977633" "Rarrgh!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P123715336" "You have discouraged Devouring Earth activity on Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1870996193" "The Devouring Earth have been a problem on Peregrine Island for as long as I can remember. Thanks for doing something about it, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P2017953744" "If the Devouring Earth know what's good for them, they'll keep their paws off Peregrine Island!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Portal_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2736575573" "Nemesis has his soldiers hanging around Peregrine Island lately, and it's gotten to be something of a concern. It seems everyone in Paragon City wants a piece of Portal Corporation's technology. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to hit the streets and show Nemesis his men aren't welcome.</A> Against an opponent as strong as Nemesis, a good offense is the best defense."
// AcceptString :
